{ ==============================================================================
  S16_S - MOVING AVERAGE CROSS SHORT STRATEGY
  Signal Name : S16_S_MACrossShort
  MC Load Name: STRATEGY_GEN_S16_S_MACrossShort
  Version     : v1.26.0   Build_ID 260826

  ANCHOR -- every input at the default in this file
      160 trades / 2,796,800 / PF 2.3295303290 / -337,200
      MEASURED BEFORE the 2026-08-21 changes. NOT yet re-measured with
      KB_Block_Support at 0 and the two-bar session gates in place.
      Re-run before reading any result off this file.

  v1.25.0 is still reachable: set KB_Block_Support, KB_Block_Oppose,
  KB_Block_Neutral, KB_Filter_Mode and KB_Filter_Win all to 0.
      180 trades / 2,615,600 / PF 2.0923822252 / -364,800

  MC12 KEEPS THE PREVIOUS RUN'S INPUT VALUES rather than rereading this
  file, and it compiles into its own database rather than reading from
  disk. Confirm Build_ID in the settings dialog before every batch --
  six batches were voided this month for exactly that reason.

  30 bearish and bullish structures, pro-short 1-15, anti-short 16-28,
  neutral 29-30. First match writes v_KB_Code and stops; the gate is the
  single comparison v_KB_Code = 0.

  THE COMMENTS THAT USED TO SIT HERE ARE IN
      docs/research/S16S_v1260_comment_record.md
  moved by scripts/slim_pla_v2.py, which strips every comment from the
  before and after files and refuses to write unless the remainder is
  byte-identical. Not one character of code changed. Each block left a
  numbered pointer where it used to be.

  Design record : docs/research/S16S_design_record.md
  Pattern spec  : docs/research/S16S_kbar_pattern_spec_20260816.md
  Input snapshot: docs/build_snapshots/S16_S_MACrossShort_v1.26.0.txt
  ============================================================================== }

